    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like Asteroids or early Zelda games, <strong>Hello Space</strong> is a 2D action game where you control a spaceship, defeat enemies and overcome deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend your arsenal by collecting new weapons and technologies for your ship that are required to conquer four different dungeon-like worlds that are all connected by a more open space that comes with its own surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/666c812a383bdca7033ac7899edc80b3.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=454 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Enemy: the <strong>Insectoids</strong> \u2013 an artificial hive mind commanding countless armed spacecraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows exactly when or how this war began. But one thing is certain: it must end.<br>You are part of the elite \u2013 a one-man army \u2013 sent on a daring mission: to turn the tide at last by striking directly at the swarm's critical infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/ac3adc95fa95407ff9387de317aae438.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the vastness of space \u2013 an open, mysterious world filled with danger and discovery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters, complete exciting missions, and uncover hidden secrets. Gather valuable gear and helpful items to aid you in your fight against the menacing <strong>Insectoids</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/44e4fd6e3ddd3f0de0b328b4eea6684f.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During your mission, you'll uncover advanced technologies that turn you into a more effective fighter and resourceful explorer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ship with powerful enhancements like the Thrust Drive, Gravitation Core, Nanobots, and more to overcome even the toughest obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/3c5558665ad9bc7fa77bdc88346df2cf.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=108 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/111424bf701a50cd2bca6d81f12b863b.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/85ba41f11fcf3ba743d1a7cbc08118ce.poster.avif?t=1751567295\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/85ba41f11fcf3ba743d1a7cbc08118ce.webm?t=1751567295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/85ba41f11fcf3ba743d1a7cbc08118ce.mp4?t=1751567295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Insectoids \u2013 a man-made fleet of deadly war machines seemingly driven by one goal: the annihilation of humanity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a wide range of combat ships, each with unique abilities, strengths, and weaknesses \u2013 from the seemingly harmless <i>Bees</i>, relying on overwhelming numbers, to the deadly <i>Wasps</i>, equipped with phasers, radioactive bombs, and teleportation technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/9b86c335025a68982dd770f6c289e9ed.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission will take you through key strategic targets\u2014each one a step toward pushing back the Insectoid threat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore treacherous locations filled with enemies, traps, and puzzles: from a mining facility for rare ores, to an intergalactic forge, to the central factory\u2014and ultimately, the Insectoids\u2019 breeding grounds: a dark, mysterious hive deep within enemy territory, the source of their relentless assault and the heart of their swarm.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like Asteroids or early Zelda games, <strong>Hello Space</strong> is a 2D action game where you control a spaceship, defeat enemies and overcome deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend your arsenal by collecting new weapons and technologies for your ship that are required to conquer four different dungeon-like worlds that are all connected by a more open space that comes with its own surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/666c812a383bdca7033ac7899edc80b3.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=454 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Enemy: the <strong>Insectoids</strong> \u2013 an artificial hive mind commanding countless armed spacecraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows exactly when or how this war began. But one thing is certain: it must end.<br>You are part of the elite \u2013 a one-man army \u2013 sent on a daring mission: to turn the tide at last by striking directly at the swarm's critical infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/ac3adc95fa95407ff9387de317aae438.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the vastness of space \u2013 an open, mysterious world filled with danger and discovery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters, complete exciting missions, and uncover hidden secrets. Gather valuable gear and helpful items to aid you in your fight against the menacing <strong>Insectoids</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/44e4fd6e3ddd3f0de0b328b4eea6684f.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During your mission, you'll uncover advanced technologies that turn you into a more effective fighter and resourceful explorer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ship with powerful enhancements like the Thrust Drive, Gravitation Core, Nanobots, and more to overcome even the toughest obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/3c5558665ad9bc7fa77bdc88346df2cf.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=108 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/111424bf701a50cd2bca6d81f12b863b.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/85ba41f11fcf3ba743d1a7cbc08118ce.poster.avif?t=1751567295\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/85ba41f11fcf3ba743d1a7cbc08118ce.webm?t=1751567295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/85ba41f11fcf3ba743d1a7cbc08118ce.mp4?t=1751567295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Insectoids \u2013 a man-made fleet of deadly war machines seemingly driven by one goal: the annihilation of humanity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a wide range of combat ships, each with unique abilities, strengths, and weaknesses \u2013 from the seemingly harmless <i>Bees</i>, relying on overwhelming numbers, to the deadly <i>Wasps</i>, equipped with phasers, radioactive bombs, and teleportation technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715240/extras/9b86c335025a68982dd770f6c289e9ed.avif?t=1751567295\" width=600 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission will take you through key strategic targets\u2014each one a step toward pushing back the Insectoid threat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore treacherous locations filled with enemies, traps, and puzzles: from a mining facility for rare ores, to an intergalactic forge, to the central factory\u2014and ultimately, the Insectoids\u2019 breeding grounds: a dark, mysterious hive deep within enemy territory, the source of their relentless assault and the heart of their swarm.</p>",
